<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">Acknowledgment and timeline. ORS 19=
2.324(2) requires acknowledgment or completion within five business days, a=
nd ORS 192.329(5) requires a reasonable estimated completion date where a r=
esponse cannot be completed within
 fifteen business days. I request both in writing.</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">Fees. ORS 192.324(4) prohibits a fe=
e exceeding $25 without prior written notice. If a fee is to be charged, I =
request that notice with an itemized basis before any work is performed, an=
d the opportunity to narrow the request
 rather than have it held pending payment. I have no ability to receive or =
return printed forms; any fee waiver determination should not be conditione=
d on the return of a printed document.</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">Format. Electronic delivery by emai=
l or secure link, in native format with headers, recipients, timestamps, me=
tadata, and attachments preserved and intact.</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">Preservation. Please treat all reco=
rds responsive to this request as subject to litigation hold. I have served=
 a notice of tort claim on the State of Oregon under ORS 30.275, and the De=
partment of Administrative Services
 has opened claim P195403.</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
