<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"direction: ltr; margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; fo=
nt-size: 12pt;">
<span style=3D"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);">Disposition. For each numbered item=
, please state whether responsive records exist, produce them, or cite the =
specific exemption claimed for each record or portion withheld, as ORS 192.=
329(2) requires. If any responsive
 record is withheld, identify it by date, author, recipient, and subject.</=
span></p>
